@PSS_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150

### ========== USERS ==========

### Lister tous les users
GET {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

###

### Récupérer un user par ID
GET {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Créer un user
POST {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "motdepasse123"
}

###

### Modifier un user
PUT {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nouveau@example.com"
}

###

### Supprimer un user
DELETE {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/users/1

###

### ========== SUBS ==========

### Lister toutes les subs
GET {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/subs
Accept: application/json

###

### Récupérer les subs d'un user
GET {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/subs/user/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Récupérer une sub par ID
GET {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/subs/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Créer une sub
POST {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/subs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "idManga": "manga-123",
  "nameManga": "One Piece",
  "lastChapterRead": "1100"
}

###

### Modifier une sub
PUT {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/subs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lastChapterRead": "1101"
}

###

### Supprimer une sub
DELETE {{PSS_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/subs/1

###
